From 468ec89989d6c17f2f1a5a9ffd8974a3ef155577 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daedalao <daedalao@hotmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 21:12:19 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 05/12] linux/ppc: enable cgo (external linking)

Add runtime/cgo crosscall glue for 32-bit ppc, use RELA relocations in
the ELF32 object handed to the external linker, and mark linux/ppc as
cgo-capable with external linking required.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0117Su2urNmg96oYM6vhHi1y
